"Elasar owns Drathok by a true soul contract; he took Drathok in and expects coin of him."
"Elasar holds Drathok's daughter hostage, and threatens her hands and eyes."
"Elasar wants Markus Brown broken and serving him in totality, as pawn or as tribute."
"Elasar appraised Markus, gasped, demanded a contract, then learned Drathok held Markus's soul."
"Elasar fears the gods would aim a taught Mana Manipulator at demons and annihilate them."
"Elasar ordered Drathok to cut Markus off from gods until Markus is desperate enough to sign."
"Elasar's way: deprive a being of alternatives, trick it, then force the most predatory contract."
"Elasar had a deal with Randall that only Markus be endangered; Randall's murderous intent broke it."
"Elasar believes Drathok's lie that Markus came through Randall's bout whole and unbroken."
"Elasar knows nothing of the deal Drathok struck with Serena."
"Elasar may hold a master ring that overrides every Ring of Control he has sold."
"Elasar fears a vanished goddess whose name begins Ser-, and forbids her name."
"Elasar wants control of the whole cosmic order, not just Firrelia."
"A ward on Elasar's name makes some who hear of him forget the telling at once."
"Serena wants Elasar dead and replaced; her quest to kill him pays over two hundred Faith."
